      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, I think I'm following. So as long as the logic is industry standard and I'm not literally lifting their specific implementation, I should be safe.\n\nOne more thing: in these kinds of tech contracts, is there a common way to actually define \"residuals\" more clearly so there isn't this much ambiguity? Like, is there a standard fallback definition used in software NDAs to make sure developers can actually walk away with their skills intact without fear of being sued?",
